This package is the complete system: backend (Django), frontend (Angular), every database migration, a settings template and a first-time setup command. It was installed from an empty database and checked before release:
- the full migration ran;
- `setup_zeo` created the company and administrator;
- login worked;
- a department, a designation, a category and an employee were created;
- leave, payroll, expenses, reports, organisation, shifts, attendance, assets, employee profile and self-service all answered;
- a second company in Saudi Arabia got the Saudi country pack (captions, rule set, no WPS SIF file);
- the Arabic language pack loaded and the screens switched to Arabic, right-to-left.

| Folder | What |
|---|---|
| `zeo-hrms/` | Backend (Python / Django) |
| `zeo-frontend/hrms-project/` | Frontend source (Angular 17) |
| `frontend-build/` | Ready-built frontend. Copy it to the web server if you do not want to build it yourself |
